Codex's shader-set v3.1 (~/Downloads/shader-set-phase1/out-1c/shader-set.v3.1.patch, NOTES.md and
READY.md there), drafted against the T88 core and rebased onto T93: one hunk of
vk_pipeline_cache.cpp (LoadDiskResources, the used-list test) merged by hand with 0499's
