(tools/prepare-vulkan-port.py anchors on the constructor's end). The extractor (core/file_sys/nx2_shader_extract.*) is Fritchii's file. Test order:
A = EDEN_UP_CANONICAL_KEYS=1 alone; B = + EDEN_UP_SHADER_SET=1 (needs EDEN_UP_NUP_LAZY_DECODE=1 and
the wrapped recipe beside the pipeline cache); C = + EDEN_UP_SHADER_SET_PREP_ALL=1.

